# Compiled binary (produced by `go build ./cmd/jig`)
/jig

# jig run artifacts & engine records (kept outside the working tree by design)
.jig/

# Go build/test output
*.test
*.out
coverage.out

# Editor / OS cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp
/.claude/worktrees

# docs/ is ephemeral by default: specs, plans, epics, ADRs, and one-off
# design notes live on disk for agents to read but are not committed.
# Only the durable reference docs in AGENTS.md's reading map are tracked.
docs/*
!docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
!docs/CONVENTIONS.md
!docs/GRAPH_ENGINEERING.md
!docs/TUI.md
!docs/TESTING.md
!docs/workflow-schema.md
!docs/headless.md
!docs/operations.md
!docs/security-monitoring.md
!docs/observability.md
!docs/clipboard.md
